---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Advisory for Artisanal & Small-Scale Miners"
  description="Practical support for ASM operators working toward formalisation, responsible sourcing and stronger market access."
>
  <section class="section service-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/what-we-do">&larr; What We Do</a></p>
      <h1 class="reveal">02 &middot; Advisory for Artisanal &amp; Small-Scale Miners</h1>
      <p class="lede reveal">
        Running our own ASM operation means we understand the practical
        constraints other miners face, because we face them too.
      </p>

      <div class="body-grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>What this covers</h2>
          <p>
            Formalisation support, cooperative and organisational
            structures, and responsible sourcing readiness: the practical
            requirements buyers and regulators increasingly expect. We help
            operators understand what is being asked of them and build
            toward it at a pace that fits their operation.
          </p>
          <p>
            Health, safety and environmental practice improvements sized
            realistically to an ASM operation&rsquo;s scale and resources.
            Access to traceability tools that make responsible sourcing
            claims genuinely verifiable.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal">
          <h2>How we work</h2>
          <p>
            We work on-site and in the local language wherever possible.
            Recommendations are practical and sequenced: what to fix first,
            what can wait, and what it costs to get there.
          </p>
          <p>
            Because we operate our own ASM site, our advice is grounded in
            direct operating experience alongside policy knowledge, in the
            same Sub-Saharan African conditions our clients work in.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="pill-btn" href="/contact">Talk to us about your operation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 720px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .body-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--gap);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .cta-row {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .body-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
